# Base URL of the deployed choreo-dashboard Ballerina service (the separate Choreo Service
# component - see ../choreo-dashboard/main.bal). Vite only inlines VITE_-prefixed variables, and
# only at BUILD time - set this as a build-time environment variable on the Choreo "Web
# Application" component, not something read at runtime.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-dashboard-service.choreoapis.dev
